'''Lycanroc''' (Japanese: '''ルガルガン''' ''Lugarugan'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

