==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Lycanroc}} in its {{form|Lycanroc|Dusk Form}}.
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Lycanroc}}.
*'''Lycanfang''' is derived from '''Lycanfang-''GX''''', an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Lycanroc-GX|14}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos|Sun & Moon Black Star Promos}}.

